      "side": 1,
      "message": "This happened to me recently too. It\u0027s a problem with the PR mirroring tool. It happens because:\n```\nGITHUB_PR_HEAD_SHA\u003dc4ef1f862954967f3144b37e7753f45db0801f23\nORIGINAL_AUTHOR\u003dReece Hagan \u003cdrogonmar@tuyuji.com\u003e\n```\nisn\u0027t in the correct Git footer format, so the `commit-msg` hook decides that\u0027s not the footer paragraph, and adds a new footer paragraph below it, with a new Change-Id.\nYou can fix it by separating those two lines from the actual footer (and deleting the extra Change-Id) and then reuploading.",
